## Hotels — what works 1:1

| Step | Source | Status |
|------|--------|--------|
| Live price for dates | Stay22 Direct Travel `GET /v2/accommodations?checkin&checkout` | ✅ |
| Primary only if priced | `price.total` present → book button | ✅ |
| Sold out / unpriced → alternatives | City search with prices only | ✅ |
| Affiliate deep link with dates | Stay22 Allez `aid` + checkin/checkout | ✅ |

### What does NOT work 1:1

| Wish | Gap | Why | How |
|------|-----|-----|-----|
| Guaranteed Hotel-Hanken match every time | Fuzzy name search | Stay22 geocode sometimes returns nearby only | Prefer `lat/lng` + `hotelname`; store Booking property IDs on POIs |
| High rate limits | Demo mode 5 req/min | No Stay22 API key in app yet | Set `EXPO_PUBLIC_STAY22_API_KEY` from Stay22 Hub |
| Scrape booking.com HTML | Blocked / ToS | Not allowed | Stay22 / Booking Demand API only |

Code: `src/services/concierge/hotelAvailabilityService.ts` + `hotelBookingPack.ts`

