## Apply same template to Ferry / Taxi / Tours

1. Find official live endpoint (or partner API).
2. Gate recommendations on live inventory.
3. Conversational refine.
4. Buttons = researched deep links only.
5. Document gaps in this rule file when partner APIs are missing.
